control: Each pool reports its database from the outcomes of the work run on it, clears on its own attempt to connect, and reports failed after its bound with no connection
removes: a connection attempt has no bound of its own, so one the network never answers waits on its caller and counts as nothing
packages: ./process/database
tests: TestAConnectionAttemptThatIsNeverAnsweredIsAFault
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

